== native: e-w1 -> e-w2, PostgreSQL 18 ==

-- latency: 1000 single-row transactions, one session, 50 ms apart
p50 0.2 ms, p95 0.8 ms, p99 1.6 ms, rows 1000

-- throughput: pgbench, 8 clients, 30 s, one insert per transaction
   source: tps = 96117.118311 (without initial connection time)
   source committed 2883240 rows; 2711883 were on the target when the load stopped; the rest took 1.7 s more
   target applied 90953 rows/s over the whole run, 90396 rows/s while it was loaded

-- one transaction of 1,000,000 rows
   committed on the source after 1.0 s, complete on the target 3.2 s after that
